### Commits.

## Why a commit was not made, or a branch not moved back.

# Which input was refused: the commit message.
commit-what-message = message
commit-message-required = a commit message is required
# Which operation failed or was refused.
commit-what-commit = commit
commit-head-unborn = HEAD is unborn after committing
# Which operation was refused.
commit-what-undo = undo
commit-journal-no-commit = the journal names no commit to go to; nothing was changed
